<title-group><article-title>Tranexamic acid versus placebo in hip surgery: a randomized trial</article-title></title-group>
<contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Doe</surname><given-names>Jane</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group>
<abstract><p>FRONT-MATTER ABSTRACT must not be repeated: the critic gets the abstract separately.</p></abstract>
